  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now we know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#931;</mi><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#931;</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#931;</mi><mi>n</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#931;</mi><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#931;</mi><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So putting the value in the given equation we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>